{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30392","headline":"王先生不别而去 · 赵嘏","name":"王先生不别而去","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙翁归袖拂烟霓，一卷素书还独携。\n劚药满囊身不病，抱琴何处鹤同栖？\n沾衣尽日看山坐，搔首残春向路迷。\n树树白云幽径绝，短船空倚武陵溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}